 code, the indentation level one is the same as if you were using tabs. This is why I called it an indentation *level* to be neutral.\r\n\r\nIf we want to display the actual number of spaces required, we need to do 2 things:\r\n\r\n- Detect whether the script is indented with tabs or spaces in the error message (or fetch this information from the tokenizer if we already have it).\r\n- Detect how many spaces are normally used for indentation.\r\n\r\nTherefore, I went with @AThousandShips's suggestion for now.","created_at":"2026-02-11T19:20:25Z","updated_at":"2026-02-11T19:22:04Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116152#discussion_r2795045057","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116152","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2795045057"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116152#discussion_r2795045057"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116152"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2795045057/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":1275,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2791930344,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":6,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"}]